    <description>
      <Value Culture="ar-jo"><![CDATA[الهيئة العامة للعقار]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="en-us"><![CDATA[The Real Estate General Authority (REGA) was created in 2017 with the aim of regulating, overseeing, and promoting non-governmental real estate activities. Its main goal is to attract investments to the real estate sector while aligning with the comprehensive strategy of the sector.]]></Value>
